// Power Platform dev container template
// Docs: https://github.com/TALXIS/tools-agentbox/tree/master/src/container/templates/power-platform
//
// This is all AgentBox needs. The image carries the config for its own tools (a devcontainer.metadata
// label) that every devcontainer tool merges in: tool updates and the keyring on every start, the
// TALXIS/skills plugin registration on create. It updates with the image, so nothing here needs to
// change when AgentBox does.
// Everything about your project and editor goes below: files to open, ports, settings, extensions,
// Features, machine size.
{
    "name": "Power Platform",
    "image": "ghcr.io/talxis/tools-agentbox/image:latest"
}
